00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:25.540
Committee Secretary: Infeliz, OIC USEC Christian Mark Ginkanko, USEC Melvin Carlo Barroso, and USEC Leandro

asr-000016
00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:35.860
Committee Secretary: Roa, USEC Ryan Martin Te, USEC Maria Victoria Castro, USEC Celine Melanie D, OIC USEC Pinky Jimenez,

