asr-000586
01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:37.880
Rep. Brian Poe: Representative James Jojo Ang Jr.,

asr-000587
01:02:38.120 --> 01:02:45.120
Rep. Brian Poe: Representative Ramil Hernandez, Representative Steve Tronbian Solon,

asr-000588
01:02:45.860 --> 01:02:56.240
Rep. Brian Poe: Representative Lani Mercado-Revilla, Representative Richard Gomez, and Representative Leo Rodriguez,

asr-000589
01:02:56.740 --> 01:02:58.820
Rep. Brian Poe: Eugelio Leo Rodriguez.

asr-000590
01:02:59.720 --> 01:03:07.700
Rep. Brian Poe: And before moving on to the member of majority, the first member of majority to speak, I just want to,

asr-000591
01:03:08.120 --> 01:03:15.780
Rep. Brian Poe: uh, show this on the floor. This is the official, uh, letter I spoke of earlier in, uh, the message I delivered

asr-000592
01:03:15.780 --> 01:03:22.600
Rep. Brian Poe: in which we are requesting for action on all of the complaints from Congress, uh, regarding fake news

asr-000593
01:03:22.600 --> 01:03:28.780
Rep. Brian Poe: and links that are damaging to reputations of the members of Congress. I will pass this to the

asr-000594
01:03:28.780 --> 01:03:34.140
Rep. Brian Poe: Secretary and his team, uh, for further action. Hopefully, we see action on this before we head

asr-000595
01:03:34.140 --> 01:03:38.620
Rep. Brian Poe: to plenary. Uh, with that being said,

asr-000596
01:03:40.040 --> 01:03:44.180
Rep. Brian Poe: can I check first if, uh, Representative J. Vergara is here?

asr-000597
01:03:46.660 --> 01:03:52.160
Rep. Brian Poe: Okay. Uh, moving on to the next, uh, Representative Anne Matibag, you are recognized.

asr-000598
01:03:53.820 --> 01:04:00.700
Rep. Ann Matibag: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Firstly, I would like to, um, uh, thank the DICT for making Committee on Women,

asr-000599
01:04:00.860 --> 01:04:08.460
Rep. Ann Matibag: Gender, Equality as their pilot committee and making, um, the House of Representatives paperless,

asr-000600
01:04:08.460 --> 01:04:16.800
Rep. Ann Matibag: um, technology here whenever we're gonna have, um, committee hearing. Um, also, I want to commend,

asr-000601
01:04:16.920 --> 01:04:27.480
Rep. Ann Matibag: um, Secretary Henry Aguda and the DICT family, um, Yuseg Aboy, Commissioner Ella. Um, you were

asr-000602
01:04:27.480 --> 01:04:34.100
Rep. Ann Matibag: saying, sir, kanina, no, na this will be a pilot yung Philippines wherein we will verify the age

asr-000603
01:04:34.100 --> 01:04:38.340
Rep. Ann Matibag: verification. Truthfully, ang bait pa nga ni Secretary Henry.

asr-000604
01:04:38.460 --> 01:04:46.240
Rep. Ann Matibag: Okay. Nung nagmi-meeting kami, kasi, um, in other countries, diba, totally banned na ang meta,

asr-000605
01:04:46.880 --> 01:04:52.760
Rep. Ann Matibag: ang any kind of platforms, whenever these things are already happening. So, during the meeting,

asr-000606
01:04:52.840 --> 01:04:59.040
Rep. Ann Matibag: I don't know if I have, I have to, ano, tell this now, pero during the meeting, I, I was very, ano,

asr-000607
01:04:59.220 --> 01:05:05.280
Rep. Ann Matibag: parang I was just trying to observe everything, pero, you know, Secretary Henry, no, we have

asr-000608
01:05:05.280 --> 01:05:07.720
Rep. Ann Matibag: already house bill, we're already preparing.

asr-000609
01:05:08.460 --> 01:05:37.820
Rep. Ann Matibag: Anything that could, uh, protect the rights of the children, most especially, we are actually, um, um, preparing it already. And, uh, I also want to, um, thank, also, the Secretary's support under the House Resolution No. 900, wherein, um, directing the committees on women and gender equality, information, communications, and technology, welfare of children, public order and safety conduct, and inquiry and aid of legislation.

asr-000611
01:05:37.840 --> 01:06:07.820
Rep. Ann Matibag: into the continuing proliferation of sexual abuse and exploitation of children and child sexual abuse or exploitation materials. Um, following, Sir Secretary, the Singapore dialogue, um, I just, let's just, um, make it known to our members of the House, the clear timeline and, uh, mechanism and framework for the monitoring, um, of the

asr-000612
01:06:07.840 --> 01:06:10.180
Rep. Ann Matibag: compliance of Meta and Roblox.

asr-000613
01:06:10.660 --> 01:06:12.020
Rep. Ann Matibag: Actually, si Roblox

asr-000614
01:06:12.020 --> 01:06:13.660
Rep. Ann Matibag: yung mas nakita natin may

asr-000615
01:06:13.660 --> 01:06:15.640
Rep. Ann Matibag: solusyon agad with the

asr-000616
01:06:15.640 --> 01:06:17.900
Rep. Ann Matibag: age, um, um, personality verification.

asr-000617
01:06:18.820 --> 01:06:19.260
Rep. Ann Matibag: Um,

asr-000618
01:06:20.040 --> 01:06:21.740
Rep. Ann Matibag: uh, maybe we can just

asr-000619
01:06:21.740 --> 01:06:23.800
Rep. Ann Matibag: discuss a little, Sir, yung timeline

asr-000620
01:06:23.800 --> 01:06:25.720
Rep. Ann Matibag: talaga. Kasi, okay,

asr-000621
01:06:25.900 --> 01:06:27.860
Rep. Ann Matibag: we already had a meeting, pumunta pa po

asr-000622
01:06:27.860 --> 01:06:29.880
Rep. Ann Matibag: tayo ng Singapore, ano, pero

asr-000623
01:06:29.880 --> 01:06:31.980
Rep. Ann Matibag: what is really the most important

asr-000624
01:06:31.980 --> 01:06:33.920
Rep. Ann Matibag: thing here is kailan sila pupunta

asr-000625
01:06:33.920 --> 01:06:35.980
Rep. Ann Matibag: dito to finally set up

asr-000626
01:06:35.980 --> 01:06:37.680
Rep. Ann Matibag: their office so that they will,

asr-000627
01:06:37.840 --> 01:06:40.840
Rep. Ann Matibag: have a jurisdiction or they will follow the laws of the Philippines.

asr-000628
01:06:42.740 --> 01:06:46.280
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, concrete timelines po.

asr-000629
01:06:46.780 --> 01:06:52.440
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Ang sinabi namin kay ROBLOX, no later than October, they should comply.

asr-000630
01:06:53.020 --> 01:06:59.600
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: For the committee's appreciation, there were five demands we gave to ROBLOX since May pa.

asr-000631
01:06:59.600 --> 01:07:07.080
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: So one, dapat i-segment na nila yung platform nila.

asr-000632
01:07:07.080 --> 01:07:11.040
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Ginawa nilang ROBLOX for Kids, ROBLOX Select, tapos ROBLOX.

asr-000633
01:07:11.540 --> 01:07:12.620
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Wala po yan dati.

asr-000634
01:07:12.900 --> 01:07:16.340
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Noong May, na kinol natin yung attention nila, tumugman naman sila.

asr-000635
01:07:16.500 --> 01:07:17.340
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: So linagay nila.

asr-000636
01:07:17.440 --> 01:07:19.900
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Yung second, na nag-comply sila, yung chat.

asr-000637
01:07:20.840 --> 01:07:25.340
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Yung chat ng mga bata doon, ano yun, binabantayan po ng ROBLOX yun.

asr-000638
01:07:25.340 --> 01:07:31.920
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: So makikita nila yung mga keywords na related to NVE, related to sexual acts, etc.

asr-000639
01:07:32.440 --> 01:07:35.940
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Malalaman nila kung ano yung pinag-usapan ng mga bata.

asr-000640
01:07:36.340 --> 01:07:37.060
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Kaya minsan,

asr-000641
01:07:37.080 --> 01:07:39.900
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: yung mga kabataan, hindi doon sa ROBLOX nagplaplano.

asr-000642
01:07:40.060 --> 01:07:41.660
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Lumalabas sila ng another chat.

asr-000643
01:07:42.200 --> 01:07:46.320
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Pangatlo, yung parental control, default na po sa ROBLOX.

asr-000644
01:07:46.760 --> 01:07:51.780
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Yung dalawa na kailangan nila mag-comply, yung magtayo ng opisina sa Pilipinas,

asr-000645
01:07:51.960 --> 01:07:55.920
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: pero sinared na po nila sa amin, meron na po silang hinare na 300 people,

asr-000646
01:07:56.600 --> 01:08:00.500
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: not through ROBLOX directly, but through a partner of ROBLOX.

asr-000647
01:08:01.140 --> 01:08:04.840
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Nagtayo na rin po sila ng opisina sa Singapore.

asr-000648
01:08:05.100 --> 01:08:07.040
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Dati po, walang opisina ROBLOX sa Singapore.

asr-000649
01:08:07.080 --> 01:08:10.460
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Inuna muna nila yung Singapore, may lima na silang empleyado.

asr-000650
01:08:11.120 --> 01:08:13.480
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Tapos isusunod na nila yung sa Pilipinas.

asr-000651
01:08:14.080 --> 01:08:18.300
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Yung fifth na lang nakulang is yung age verification through the national ID.

asr-000652
01:08:18.920 --> 01:08:23.060
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: So by October, dapat o kompleto na po si ROBLOX.

asr-000653
01:08:23.160 --> 01:08:28.340
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Again, I keep repeating ROBLOX kasi they can become the template for the other social media platform.

asr-000654
01:08:28.480 --> 01:08:31.540
DICT Secretary Henry Rhoel Aguda: Kung nagawa nila, yung iba dapat magawa rin.

asr-000655
01:08:32.040 --> 01:08:37.060
